@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@targetUserId =
@impersonationToken =

### List users (needs an ADMIN session; run the login request from auth.http first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users?limit=20&order=desc

### Next page: paste pageInfo.nextCursor from the previous response. `q` searches the nickname.
# GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users?cursor=<nextCursor>&q=ada

### Audit log (ADMIN only, read only). Filters: action, order, cursor, limit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/audit-events?limit=20&order=desc

### Only one action
# GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/audit-events?action=user.password_changed

###
### Issue an impersonation token for a non-admin user (valid for 10 minutes)
# @name issueImpersonationToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/{{targetUserId}}/impersonation-token
Origin: {{baseUrl}}

###
### Start the impersonation session.
### Run it from a client WITHOUT an active session (409 otherwise).
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/impersonate
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{baseUrl}}

{
  "token": "{{impersonationToken}}"
}
